The five discipline skills in this folder (verification-before-completion,
systematic-debugging, test-driven-development, receiving-code-review, writing-plans)
are adapted from obra/superpowers (https://github.com/obra/superpowers, commit 22f0b46,
version 7.0.2), Copyright (c) 2025 Jesse Vincent, licensed under the MIT License. The
full license text is in LICENSE-superpowers in this folder.

Changes from the original superpowers skills: references to skills that are not part of
this workflow were replaced with the ticket flow in WORKFLOW.md (writing-plans,
systematic-debugging, test-driven-development), the plan folder is docs/plans/, and the
find-polluter.sh helper was replaced by manual bisection steps
(systematic-debugging/root-cause-tracing.md).

The ui-design skill in this folder adapts numerical art-direction, layout discipline,
and browser verification principles from Leonxlnx/taste-skill
(https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill, Copyright (c) 2026 Leonxlnx, MIT License)
and integrates browser automation workflows for vercel-labs/agent-browser
(https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser, Apache License 2.0).
